[{"ave_id":"AVE-2024-0557","file_name":"2024/AVE-2024-0557.toml","cve_id":"CVE-2024-54683","title":"Linux Kernel netfilter IDLETIMER ABBA死锁漏洞","description":"Linux 内核 netfilter 子系统的 IDLETIMER 模块存在 ABBA 死锁漏洞。当删除引用某个 idletimer 的最后一条 iptables 规则时，若同时读取 sysfs 中该定时器的状态文件，将导致内核发生循环锁依赖（kn->active 与 list_mutex 互相等待），最终触发系统死锁。本地低权限攻击者可通过并发执行 iptables 规则删除与 sysfs 文件读取操作，造成内核软锁或系统崩溃，影响可用性。该漏洞影响使用 netfilter IDLETIMER 功能的 Linux 内核版本，CVSS 评分 5.5，危害等级中等。","severity":"MEDIUM","score":5.5,"aliases":["CVE-2024-54683"],"sources":["msrc"],"published":"2025-01-11T13:15:27.490","updated":"2026-06-17T08:10:38.287","remediation":"立即更新 Linux 内核至 6.6.67、6.12.6 或 6.13 及以上版本，该漏洞已在对应稳定分支中修复。Ubuntu 24.04 LTS 用户升级至 linux-image-6.11.0-1011-lowlatency 及以上版本（USN-7381-1），SUSE Linux Enterprise 15 SP6/SP7 用户安装 SUSE-SU-2025:1177-1 或 SUSE-SU-2025:01951-1 更新。如无法立即升级，避免在 IDLETIMER 规则与 sysfs 读取操作同时高并发执行，以降低触发死锁概率。","status":"completed","collected_at":"2026-07-22T00:00:00Z","references":["https://git.kernel.org/stable/c/45fe76573a2557f632e248cc141342233f422b9a","https://git.kernel.org/stable/c/8c2c8445cda8f59c38dec7dc10509bcb23ae26a0","https://git.kernel.org/stable/c/f36b01994d68ffc253c8296e2228dfe6e6431c03","https://github.com/trickest/cve/blob/ed228d55b7972f63e700a35a54fbcd94064b9ade/2024/CVE-2024-54683.md","https://github.com/CVEProject/cvelistV5/blob/6e1fee15e021f95477107e3e5d652470f76f7bac/cves/2024/54xxx/CVE-2024-54683.json","https://github.com/NUS-Curiosity/KernJC/blob/798845a541a5396395c7e0c1670cb4872dac7105/db/vuln_desc/2024/CVE-2024-54683.yaml","https://github.com/cisagov/vulnrichment/blob/40201653244e9d985cea536a2ac651eca18f5fd4/2024/54xxx/CVE-2024-54683.json","https://github.com/imSkows/Cyber-Vulnerability-Analysis-Data/blob/db26c44c5f45c25514223a46675daec7eea03092/data/first/CVE-2024-54683","https://github.com/bell-sw/osv-database/blob/ee84993ad655ae5f90f9948f27d13851ad8b9fd3/BELL-CVE/BELL-CVE-2024-54683.json","https://github.com/mabitoski/cve_submodules/blob/44ad7e2705b3aef1b2ffaf64bd47596c10a6c2e4/2024/CVE-2024-54683.md","https://github.com/github/advisory-database/blob/74884340187670a91b9d5bdb799b52e73426ad63/advisories/unreviewed/2025/01/GHSA-4qcv-j3wr-hw24/GHSA-4qcv-j3wr-hw24.json","https://github.com/TonneauBenjamin/ANSSI_Project/blob/f0e2d5e8be75f0351e759642d04d728399b4faa9/data/raw/first/CVE-2024-54683","https://github.com/Patrowl/PatrowlHearsData/blob/d449633638bc4d33beb359a70dee0dbe66d39a20/SSVC/data/2024/CVE-2024-54683.json"],"poc_urls":[],"exp_urls":[],"repo_poc_urls":[],"repo_exp_urls":[],"has_poc":false,"has_exp":false,"raw_url":"https://github.com/adysec/AVE/blob/main/vulns/2024/AVE-2024-0557.toml"},{"ave_id":"AVE-2024-0556","file_name":"2024/AVE-2024-0556.toml","cve_id":"CVE-2024-54680","title":"Linux Kernel SMB 客户端 TCP 计时器死锁漏洞","description":"Linux 内核 SMB/CIFS 客户端中存在 TCP 计时器死锁漏洞，当卸载 SMB 客户端内核模块（rmmod）时，TCP 计时器未能正确清理，导致内核线程陷入死锁状态，可能引发系统崩溃或拒绝服务。该漏洞影响使用 SMB/CIFS 文件系统的 Linux 系统，攻击者可通过诱导系统卸载 SMB 模块触发此问题。Ubuntu 24.04 LTS 等发行版已在相关安全更新中修复此漏洞。","severity":"MEDIUM","score":5.0,"aliases":["CVE-2024-54680"],"sources":["msrc"],"published":"2025-01-11T13:15:27.340","updated":"2025-04-02T16:15:35.587","remediation":"CVE-2024-54680 已被 Linux CNA 于 2025-04-02 正式驳回（REJECTED），该编号对应的 SMB 客户端 TCP 计时器死锁问题被认定为非安全缺陷，无需安装任何安全更新或采取缓解措施。","status":"completed","collected_at":"2026-07-22T00:00:00Z","references":["https://github.com/CVEProject/cvelistV5/blob/6e1fee15e021f95477107e3e5d652470f76f7bac/cves/2024/54xxx/CVE-2024-54680.json","https://github.com/trickest/cve/blob/ed228d55b7972f63e700a35a54fbcd94064b9ade/2025/CVE-2025-22077.md","https://github.com/cisagov/vulnrichment/blob/40201653244e9d985cea536a2ac651eca18f5fd4/2024/54xxx/CVE-2024-54680.json","https://github.com/imSkows/Cyber-Vulnerability-Analysis-Data/blob/db26c44c5f45c25514223a46675daec7eea03092/data/mitre/CVE-2024-54680","https://github.com/AwwMann99/VulneRAG/blob/09adf154d3574ffded6af925a6311b0a20df9db0/docs/Cve_Data/cve_md/CVE-2024-54680.md","https://github.com/github/advisory-database/blob/39aab03fcd8441626e5dea87058d434f682ec433/advisories/unreviewed/2025/01/GHSA-xfp4-237c-chrm/GHSA-xfp4-237c-chrm.json","https://github.com/0xMarcio/cve/blob/c6c9e305761264e104c5de70e59376c519bbfef3/2025/CVE-2025-22077.md","https://github.com/TonneauBenjamin/ANSSI_Project/blob/f0e2d5e8be75f0351e759642d04d728399b4faa9/data/raw/mitre/CVE-2024-54680","https://github.com/Patrowl/PatrowlHearsData/blob/d449633638bc4d33beb359a70dee0dbe66d39a20/CVE/data/2024/CVE-2024-54680.json","https://github.com/canonical/ubuntu-security-notices/blob/bd141078a7ff2a16f9bd8cc62066eb74bbd40e0e/usn/7379-2.json"],"poc_urls":[],"exp_urls":[],"repo_poc_urls":[],"repo_exp_urls":[],"has_poc":false,"has_exp":false,"raw_url":"https://github.com/adysec/AVE/blob/main/vulns/2024/AVE-2024-0556.toml"},{"ave_id":"AVE-2024-0554","file_name":"2024/AVE-2024-0554.toml","cve_id":"CVE-2024-53687","title":"Linux Kernel RISC-V kfence 内存保护中断处理不当导致拒绝服务漏洞","description":"Linux 内核 RISC-V 架构的 kfence 内存调试子系统中的 kfence_protect_page() 函数在禁用中断的上下文中调用了 flush_tlb_kernel_range()，该函数可能通过核间中断（IPI）向所有 CPU 核心发送 TLB 刷新请求，导致在中断关闭时触发内核警告（smp_call_function_many_cond 中的 WARN_ON），可能引发系统不稳定或拒绝服务。本地攻击者只需低权限即可通过触发特定内存分配释放路径来利用此漏洞。该漏洞影响 Linux 内核 RISC-V 架构版本，CVSS 评分 5.5，危害等级中等。","severity":"MEDIUM","score":5.5,"aliases":["CVE-2024-53687"],"sources":["msrc"],"published":"2025-01-11T13:15:26.120","updated":"2026-06-17T08:09:06.133","remediation":"立即将 Linux 内核升级至 6.6.67、6.12.6 或 6.13 及以上版本，对应提交为 b3431a8bb336、6f796a6a396d 和 3abfc4130c42。Ubuntu 用户安装 USN-7381-1 或 USN-7514-1 安全更新。RISC-V 架构下若无法立即升级，可临时禁用 kfence 内核调试功能（内核启动参数添加 kfence.sample_interval=0）作为缓解措施。","status":"completed","collected_at":"2026-07-22T00:00:00Z","references":["https://git.kernel.org/stable/c/3abfc4130c4222099c69d023fed97f1180a8ad7b","https://git.kernel.org/stable/c/6f796a6a396d6f963f2cc8f5edd7dfba2cca097f","https://git.kernel.org/stable/c/b3431a8bb336cece8adc452437befa7d4534b2fd","https://github.com/trickest/cve/blob/ed228d55b7972f63e700a35a54fbcd94064b9ade/2024/CVE-2024-53687.md","https://github.com/CVEProject/cvelistV5/blob/6e1fee15e021f95477107e3e5d652470f76f7bac/cves/2024/53xxx/CVE-2024-53687.json","https://github.com/imSkows/Cyber-Vulnerability-Analysis-Data/blob/db26c44c5f45c25514223a46675daec7eea03092/data/first/CVE-2024-53687","https://github.com/NUS-Curiosity/KernJC/blob/798845a541a5396395c7e0c1670cb4872dac7105/db/vuln_desc/2024/CVE-2024-53687.yaml","https://github.com/bell-sw/osv-database/blob/ee84993ad655ae5f90f9948f27d13851ad8b9fd3/BELL-CVE/BELL-CVE-2024-53687.json","https://github.com/mabitoski/cve_submodules/blob/44ad7e2705b3aef1b2ffaf64bd47596c10a6c2e4/2024/CVE-2024-53687.md","https://github.com/Patrowl/PatrowlHearsData/blob/d449633638bc4d33beb359a70dee0dbe66d39a20/CVE/data/2024/CVE-2024-53687.json","https://github.com/Hashmire/cpeApplicabilityGeneratorPages/blob/4588dccb1f913705444975eb2a5eb79962bf2513/generated_pages/CVE-2024-53687.html","https://github.com/github/advisory-database/blob/ece131eb82ceb38a160571408bcbbb92bfa0f3c0/advisories/unreviewed/2025/01/GHSA-g9vj-48f4-62vj/GHSA-g9vj-48f4-62vj.json","https://github.com/TonneauBenjamin/ANSSI_Project/blob/f0e2d5e8be75f0351e759642d04d728399b4faa9/data/raw/first/CVE-2024-53687"],"poc_urls":[],"exp_urls":[],"repo_poc_urls":[],"repo_exp_urls":[],"has_poc":false,"has_exp":false,"raw_url":"https://github.com/adysec/AVE/blob/main/vulns/2024/AVE-2024-0554.toml"},{"ave_id":"AVE-2024-0540","file_name":"2024/AVE-2024-0540.toml","cve_id":"CVE-2024-49569","title":"Linux Kernel nvme-rdma 驱动管理队列销毁前未取消静默导致内核挂起漏洞","description":"Linux 内核 nvme-rdma 驱动中存在释放后使用漏洞，在创建 NVMe over RDMA 控制器失败时，驱动对 admin 队列执行了静默（quiesce）操作但未在销毁前取消静默（unquiesce），导致待处理请求无法被排空，内核线程永久阻塞在 blk_mq_freeze_queue_wait() 上，造成系统拒绝服务。攻击者需具备相邻网络访问权限和低权限账户，通过触发控制器创建失败即可利用该漏洞。CVSS 评分 5.7，危害等级中等。Linux 内核主线已提交补丁修复此问题。","severity":"MEDIUM","score":5.7,"aliases":["CVE-2024-49569"],"sources":["msrc"],"published":"2025-01-11T13:15:23.840","updated":"2026-06-17T07:59:59.503","remediation":"立即升级 Linux 内核至 6.6.88、6.12.5 或 6.13 及以上版本，或合入修复补丁 05b436f3cf65、427036030f4d、5858b6875598。Ubuntu 24.04 LTS 用户请安装 USN-7381-1 或 USN-7450-1 安全更新。如无法立即升级，可在不影响业务的前提下限制对 nvme-rdma 设备的本地访问权限作为临时缓解。","status":"completed","collected_at":"2026-07-22T00:00:00Z","references":["https://git.kernel.org/stable/c/05b436f3cf65c957eff86c5ea5ddfa2604b32c63","https://git.kernel.org/stable/c/427036030f4d796533dcadba9b845896cb6c10a7","https://git.kernel.org/stable/c/5858b687559809f05393af745cbadf06dee61295","https://github.com/trickest/cve/blob/ed228d55b7972f63e700a35a54fbcd94064b9ade/2024/CVE-2024-49569.md","https://github.com/CVEProject/cvelistV5/blob/97700d7e657426c8e1ee6cf44a0a2b88c60738c3/cves/2024/49xxx/CVE-2024-49569.json","https://github.com/NUS-Curiosity/KernJC/blob/798845a541a5396395c7e0c1670cb4872dac7105/db/vuln_desc/2024/CVE-2024-49569.yaml","https://github.com/imSkows/Cyber-Vulnerability-Analysis-Data/blob/db26c44c5f45c25514223a46675daec7eea03092/data/first/CVE-2024-49569","https://github.com/0xMarcio/cve/blob/c6c9e305761264e104c5de70e59376c519bbfef3/2024/CVE-2024-49569.md","https://github.com/bell-sw/osv-database/blob/ee84993ad655ae5f90f9948f27d13851ad8b9fd3/BELL-CVE/BELL-CVE-2024-49569.json","https://github.com/Patrowl/PatrowlHearsData/blob/800f04b3cfadd1b9ab0343f5b9acd785dbc1e953/CVE/data/2024/CVE-2024-49569.json","https://github.com/Hashmire/cpeApplicabilityGeneratorPages/blob/4588dccb1f913705444975eb2a5eb79962bf2513/generated_pages/CVE-2024-49569.html","https://github.com/joaop9425/manual-do-tecnico/blob/cc6e0f5304777f18e55db554da5372bc31d4cae1/src/content/noticias/2026/02/18/seguranca/cve-2024-49569-nvme-rdma-unquiesce-admin-q-before--1771409203000.md","https://github.com/github/advisory-database/blob/d8c03b84658bbca948e09e4af723cb11141fb41e/advisories/unreviewed/2025/01/GHSA-q2m4-pgh8-728f/GHSA-q2m4-pgh8-728f.json"],"poc_urls":[],"exp_urls":[],"repo_poc_urls":[],"repo_exp_urls":[],"has_poc":false,"has_exp":false,"raw_url":"https://github.com/adysec/AVE/blob/main/vulns/2024/AVE-2024-0540.toml"},{"ave_id":"AVE-2024-0539","file_name":"2024/AVE-2024-0539.toml","cve_id":"CVE-2024-49568","title":"Linux Kernel SMC 协议提议消息验证不足导致拒绝服务漏洞","description":"Linux 内核 net/smc（共享内存通信）子系统中存在输入验证缺陷，服务端在处理客户端发送的 proposal 消息时，未对 v2_ext_offset、eid_cnt、ism_gid_cnt 等字段进行充分校验。攻击者可利用该漏洞，通过构造特制的 proposal 消息，使 v2_ext_offset 超出合法范围，导致内核访问错误内存地址，引发系统崩溃。该漏洞需本地低权限访问，CVSS 评分 5.5，仅影响系统可用性。","severity":"MEDIUM","score":5.5,"aliases":["CVE-2024-49568"],"sources":["msrc"],"published":"2025-01-11T13:15:23.637","updated":"2026-06-17T07:59:59.403","remediation":"立即更新 Linux 内核至 6.6.68、6.12.7 或 6.13 及以上版本，对应补丁提交为 295a92e3df32、42f6beb2d577、7863c9f3d24b。各发行版用户请安装对应内核更新包：Ubuntu 24.04 LTS 更新至 linux-image-6.11.0-1011-lowlatency（USN-7381-1），SUSE Linux Enterprise 15 SP7 安装 SUSE-SU-2025:02307-1 更新。如无法立即升级，可在不需要 SMC 协议的系统上通过 modprobe.blacklist=smc 内核参数禁用 SMC 模块作为临时缓解措施。","status":"completed","collected_at":"2026-07-22T00:00:00Z","references":["https://git.kernel.org/stable/c/295a92e3df32e72aff0f4bc25c310e349d07ffbf","https://git.kernel.org/stable/c/42f6beb2d5779429417b5f8115a4e3fa695d2a6c","https://git.kernel.org/stable/c/7863c9f3d24ba49dbead7e03dfbe40deb5888fdf","https://github.com/trickest/cve/blob/ed228d55b7972f63e700a35a54fbcd94064b9ade/2024/CVE-2024-49568.md","https://github.com/CVEProject/cvelistV5/blob/97700d7e657426c8e1ee6cf44a0a2b88c60738c3/cves/2024/49xxx/CVE-2024-49568.json","https://github.com/NUS-Curiosity/KernJC/blob/798845a541a5396395c7e0c1670cb4872dac7105/db/vuln_desc/2024/CVE-2024-49568.yaml","https://github.com/imSkows/Cyber-Vulnerability-Analysis-Data/blob/db26c44c5f45c25514223a46675daec7eea03092/data/first/CVE-2024-49568","https://github.com/bell-sw/osv-database/blob/ee84993ad655ae5f90f9948f27d13851ad8b9fd3/BELL-CVE/BELL-CVE-2024-49568.json","https://github.com/Patrowl/PatrowlHearsData/blob/f0111a41156462d46f484c055bdeafa69cf38c8e/CVE/data/2024/CVE-2024-49568.json","https://github.com/mabitoski/cve_submodules/blob/44ad7e2705b3aef1b2ffaf64bd47596c10a6c2e4/2024/CVE-2024-49568.md","https://github.com/Hashmire/cpeApplicabilityGeneratorPages/blob/4588dccb1f913705444975eb2a5eb79962bf2513/generated_pages/CVE-2024-49568.html","https://github.com/github/advisory-database/blob/d8c03b84658bbca948e09e4af723cb11141fb41e/advisories/unreviewed/2025/01/GHSA-rgx8-6674-j479/GHSA-rgx8-6674-j479.json","https://github.com/TonneauBenjamin/ANSSI_Project/blob/f0e2d5e8be75f0351e759642d04d728399b4faa9/data/raw/first/CVE-2024-49568"],"poc_urls":[],"exp_urls":[],"repo_poc_urls":[],"repo_exp_urls":[],"has_poc":false,"has_exp":false,"raw_url":"https://github.com/adysec/AVE/blob/main/vulns/2024/AVE-2024-0539.toml"},{"ave_id":"AVE-2024-0537","file_name":"2024/AVE-2024-0537.toml","cve_id":"CVE-2024-48881","title":"Linux Kernel bcache 空指针解引用漏洞","description":"Linux 内核 bcache 子系统中存在空指针解引用漏洞。提交 028ddcac477b 移除了节点分配中的 NULL 指针检查，将 IS_ERR_OR_NULL 替换为 IS_ERR，导致在 cache_set_flush() 函数中，当 c->root 因注册流程失败而为 NULL 时，代码仍尝试访问其成员，引发空指针解引用，造成系统崩溃。本地攻击者需具备低权限即可触发此漏洞，影响系统可用性。该漏洞 CVSS 评分 5.5，危害等级中危。","severity":"MEDIUM","score":5.5,"aliases":["CVE-2024-48881"],"sources":["msrc"],"published":"2025-01-11T13:15:23.437","updated":"2026-06-17T07:58:57.513","remediation":"更新 Linux 内核至包含提交 028ddcac477b 回退补丁的版本（主线内核 ≥ 6.12，或各发行版已合入该修复的内核包）。Debian 11 用户升级至 linux 5.10.234-1 及以上版本（DLA-4075），Ubuntu 24.04 LTS 用户升级至 linux-image-6.11.0-1011-lowlatency 6.11.0-1011.12~24.04.1 及以上版本（USN-7381-1）。如无法立即更新内核，可通过限制本地用户对 bcache 设备的访问权限作为临时缓解措施。","status":"completed","collected_at":"2026-07-22T00:00:00Z","references":["https://git.kernel.org/stable/c/336e30f32ae7c043fde0f6fa21586ff30bea9fe2","https://git.kernel.org/stable/c/4379c5828492a4c2a651c8f826a01453bd2b80b0","https://git.kernel.org/stable/c/5202391970ffbf81975251b3526b890ba027b715","https://git.kernel.org/stable/c/5e0e913624bcd24f3de414475018d3023f060ee1","https://git.kernel.org/stable/c/b2e382ae12a63560fca35050498e19e760adf8c0","https://git.kernel.org/stable/c/cc05aa2c0117e20fa25a3c0d915f98b8f2e78667","https://git.kernel.org/stable/c/fb5fee35bdd18316a84b5f30881a24e1415e1464","https://lists.debian.org/debian-lts-announce/2025/03/msg00001.html","https://lists.debian.org/debian-lts-announce/2025/03/msg00002.html","https://github.com/trickest/cve/blob/ed228d55b7972f63e700a35a54fbcd94064b9ade/2024/CVE-2024-48881.md","https://github.com/CVEProject/cvelistV5/blob/60bbc98c39201e6f5661b9e41f1492ce39335948/cves/2024/48xxx/CVE-2024-48881.json","https://github.com/NUS-Curiosity/KernJC/blob/798845a541a5396395c7e0c1670cb4872dac7105/db/vuln_desc/2024/CVE-2024-48881.yaml","https://github.com/imSkows/Cyber-Vulnerability-Analysis-Data/blob/db26c44c5f45c25514223a46675daec7eea03092/data/first/CVE-2024-48881","https://github.com/0xMarcio/cve/blob/c6c9e305761264e104c5de70e59376c519bbfef3/2024/CVE-2024-48881.md","https://github.com/cisagov/vulnrichment/blob/a538bd81432b918b342e413f43256da1f80b6c0d/2024/48xxx/CVE-2024-48881.json","https://github.com/bell-sw/osv-database/blob/ee84993ad655ae5f90f9948f27d13851ad8b9fd3/BELL-CVE/BELL-CVE-2024-48881.json","https://github.com/CVEProject/cve-reference-ingest-data/blob/f7fbdb78e572cf69166b06f5f222a65cac6edb53/references/CveServices-CVE-2024-48881-2025-11-03-1443","https://github.com/github/advisory-database/blob/d8c03b84658bbca948e09e4af723cb11141fb41e/advisories/unreviewed/2025/01/GHSA-2g99-pch7-3284/GHSA-2g99-pch7-3284.json","https://github.com/TonneauBenjamin/ANSSI_Project/blob/f0e2d5e8be75f0351e759642d04d728399b4faa9/data/raw/first/CVE-2024-48881"],"poc_urls":[],"exp_urls":[],"repo_poc_urls":[],"repo_exp_urls":[],"has_poc":false,"has_exp":false,"raw_url":"https://github.com/adysec/AVE/blob/main/vulns/2024/AVE-2024-0537.toml"},{"ave_id":"AVE-2024-0536","file_name":"2024/AVE-2024-0536.toml","cve_id":"CVE-2024-48875","title":"Linux 内核 btrfs 文件系统死锁漏洞","description":"Linux 内核 btrfs 文件系统在 dev_replace 设备替换功能中存在死锁漏洞（CWE-667）。当启用 RAID stripe-tree 功能并执行设备替换操作时，btrfs_map_block 函数会尝试重复获取同一个 dev_replace rwsem 读写信号量，导致任务在已持有该锁的情况下再次请求锁，触发 lockdep 检测到的递归锁定死锁。该漏洞影响启用了 RAID stripe-tree 特性的 Linux 内核 btrfs 文件系统，CVSS 3.1 评分 5.5（中等），攻击向量为本地（AV:L），攻击复杂度低（AC:L），需要低权限（PR:L），无需用户交互（UI:N），主要影响可用性（A:H）。本地攻击者可通过触发带有 RAID stripe-tree 的 btrfs 设备替换操作（如运行 fstests btrfs/011 测试），导致内核死锁引发拒绝服务。Linux 内核已通过修改 btrfs_map_block 避免在已持有 dev_replace rwsem 的任务中再次获取该锁来修复此死锁问题。","severity":"MEDIUM","score":5.5,"aliases":["CVE-2024-48875"],"sources":["msrc"],"published":"2025-01-11T13:15:22.933","updated":"2026-06-17T07:58:56.987","remediation":"建议立即升级 Linux 内核至 6.11.5、6.10.13、6.6.48、6.1.106 或 5.15.166 及以上版本（含修复提交 7a5c5b8b3b2f）。Ubuntu 24.04 LTS 用户请安装 USN-7381-1/USN-7450-1 安全更新（linux-image-6.8.0-49-generic 及以上）。如暂时无法升级内核，可临时避免在使用 RAID stripe-tree 特性的 btrfs 文件系统上执行设备替换操作，或在维护窗口卸载相关文件系统后再执行替换操作。","status":"completed","collected_at":"2026-07-22T00:00:00Z","references":["https://git.kernel.org/stable/c/8cca35cb29f81eba3e96ec44dad8696c8a2f9138","https://git.kernel.org/stable/c/a2e99dcd7aafa9d474f7d9b0740b8f93c4e156c2","https://github.com/CVEProject/cvelistV5/blob/60bbc98c39201e6f5661b9e41f1492ce39335948/cves/2024/48xxx/CVE-2024-48875.json","https://github.com/imSkows/Cyber-Vulnerability-Analysis-Data/blob/db26c44c5f45c25514223a46675daec7eea03092/data/first/CVE-2024-48875","https://github.com/cisagov/vulnrichment/blob/a538bd81432b918b342e413f43256da1f80b6c0d/2024/48xxx/CVE-2024-48875.json","https://github.com/NUS-Curiosity/KernJC/blob/798845a541a5396395c7e0c1670cb4872dac7105/db/vuln_desc/2024/CVE-2024-48875.yaml","https://github.com/bell-sw/osv-database/blob/ee84993ad655ae5f90f9948f27d13851ad8b9fd3/BELL-CVE/BELL-CVE-2024-48875.json","https://github.com/yarencheng/cve-devops-playground/blob/cbe73d6bdcced13ea57f08566d6bbf5345864f7e/content/CVE-2024-48875.md","https://github.com/joaop9425/manual-do-tecnico/blob/cc6e0f5304777f18e55db554da5372bc31d4cae1/src/content/noticias/2026/02/18/seguranca/cve-2024-48875-btrfs-dont-take-dev-replace-rwsem-o-1771412274000.md","https://github.com/github/advisory-database/blob/d8c03b84658bbca948e09e4af723cb11141fb41e/advisories/unreviewed/2025/01/GHSA-hg9v-mfmx-jx2x/GHSA-hg9v-mfmx-jx2x.json","https://github.com/TonneauBenjamin/ANSSI_Project/blob/f0e2d5e8be75f0351e759642d04d728399b4faa9/data/raw/first/CVE-2024-48875","https://github.com/Patrowl/PatrowlHearsData/blob/f0111a41156462d46f484c055bdeafa69cf38c8e/SSVC/data/2024/CVE-2024-48875.json"],"poc_urls":[],"exp_urls":[],"repo_poc_urls":[],"repo_exp_urls":[],"has_poc":false,"has_exp":false,"raw_url":"https://github.com/adysec/AVE/blob/main/vulns/2024/AVE-2024-0536.toml"},{"ave_id":"AVE-2024-0535","file_name":"2024/AVE-2024-0535.toml","cve_id":"CVE-2024-48873","title":"Linux Kernel rtw89 无线驱动空指针解引用漏洞","description":"Linux 内核 rtw89 无线网卡驱动在处理 RNR（Reduced Neighbor Report）时存在空指针解引用漏洞。函数 `ieee80211_probereq_get()` 在特定条件下可能返回 NULL，但调用方未检查其返回值便直接使用，导致空指针访问。本地低权限攻击者可利用此漏洞触发内核崩溃，造成系统拒绝服务。该漏洞影响使用 rtw89 驱动的 Realtek 无线网卡设备，CVSS 评分 5.5，危害等级中等。","severity":"MEDIUM","score":5.5,"aliases":["CVE-2024-48873"],"sources":["msrc"],"published":"2025-01-11T13:15:22.750","updated":"2026-06-17T07:58:56.577","remediation":"升级 Linux 内核至 6.6.66、6.12.5 或 6.13 及以上版本，包含提交 630d5d8f2bf6、7296e5611adb 或 1a0f54cb3fea 的补丁。各发行版用户可通过包管理器更新内核包（如 Ubuntu 运行 apt update && apt upgrade linux-image-generic），更新后重启系统生效。无法立即升级时，可卸载 rtw89 内核模块（modprobe -r rtw89_pci rtw89_core）禁用 Realtek WiFi 驱动作为临时缓解。","status":"completed","collected_at":"2026-07-22T00:00:00Z","references":["https://git.kernel.org/stable/c/1a0f54cb3fea5d087440b2bae03202c445156a8d","https://git.kernel.org/stable/c/630d5d8f2bf6b340202b6bc2c05d794bbd8e4c1c","https://git.kernel.org/stable/c/7296e5611adb2c619bd7bd3817ddde7ba865ef17","https://github.com/CVEProject/cvelistV5/blob/60bbc98c39201e6f5661b9e41f1492ce39335948/cves/2024/48xxx/CVE-2024-48873.json","https://github.com/NUS-Curiosity/KernJC/blob/798845a541a5396395c7e0c1670cb4872dac7105/db/vuln_desc/2024/CVE-2024-48873.yaml","https://github.com/cisagov/vulnrichment/blob/a538bd81432b918b342e413f43256da1f80b6c0d/2024/48xxx/CVE-2024-48873.json","https://github.com/imSkows/Cyber-Vulnerability-Analysis-Data/blob/db26c44c5f45c25514223a46675daec7eea03092/data/first/CVE-2024-48873","https://github.com/yarencheng/cve-devops-playground/blob/cbe73d6bdcced13ea57f08566d6bbf5345864f7e/content/CVE-2024-48873.md","https://github.com/bell-sw/osv-database/blob/ee84993ad655ae5f90f9948f27d13851ad8b9fd3/BELL-CVE/BELL-CVE-2024-48873.json","https://github.com/github/advisory-database/blob/d8c03b84658bbca948e09e4af723cb11141fb41e/advisories/unreviewed/2025/01/GHSA-qvj7-hg6c-8g8h/GHSA-qvj7-hg6c-8g8h.json","https://github.com/TonneauBenjamin/ANSSI_Project/blob/f0e2d5e8be75f0351e759642d04d728399b4faa9/data/raw/first/CVE-2024-48873","https://github.com/Patrowl/PatrowlHearsData/blob/f0111a41156462d46f484c055bdeafa69cf38c8e/CVE/data/2024/CVE-2024-48873.json","https://github.com/equinixmetal-images/changelog/blob/43c481d19f0a015611a5309a435c9b590b5b5bc2/flatcar/flatcar_stable.md"],"poc_urls":[],"exp_urls":[],"repo_poc_urls":[],"repo_exp_urls":[],"has_poc":false,"has_exp":false,"raw_url":"https://github.com/adysec/AVE/blob/main/vulns/2024/AVE-2024-0535.toml"},{"ave_id":"AVE-2024-0532","file_name":"2024/AVE-2024-0532.toml","cve_id":"CVE-2024-47809","title":"Linux Kernel DLM 空指针解引用漏洞","description":"Linux 内核 DLM（分布式锁管理器）子系统中存在空指针解引用漏洞。当从 request_lock() 函数调用时，由于 lkb->lkb_resource 尚未通过 attach_lkb() 完成资源分配，在特定日志输出路径下可能触发空指针解引用，导致系统崩溃（拒绝服务）。该漏洞需本地低权限用户触发，影响系统可用性，CVSS 评分 5.5，危害等级中危。","severity":"MEDIUM","score":5.5,"aliases":["CVE-2024-47809"],"sources":["msrc"],"published":"2025-01-11T13:15:22.583","updated":"2026-07-14T13:17:10.107","remediation":"立即升级 Linux 内核至以下安全版本：5.15.209 及以上、6.1.167 及以上、6.6.66 及以上、6.12.5 及以上，或直接升级至 6.13 主线版本。对应补丁提交为 2db11504ef82、6fbdc3980b70、b98333c67daf、8d55ce46dd54、e1ffea6bec96。Siemens SIMATIC S7-1500 MFP 系列用户请参考 Siemens 安全公告 SSA-019113 和 SSA-082556 更新固件。如无法立即升级，可禁用 DLM 内核模块（modprobe -r dlm）作为临时缓解措施。","status":"completed","collected_at":"2026-07-22T00:00:00Z","references":["https://git.kernel.org/stable/c/2db11504ef82a60c1a2063ba7431a5cd013ecfcb","https://git.kernel.org/stable/c/6fbdc3980b70e9c1c86eccea7d5ee68108008fa7","https://git.kernel.org/stable/c/8d55ce46dd543c6965970ce70c22c3076dd35b1e","https://git.kernel.org/stable/c/b98333c67daf887c724cd692e88e2db9418c0861","https://git.kernel.org/stable/c/e1ffea6bec96d4349dbfcc42ad3e436259f64243","https://cert-portal.siemens.com/productcert/html/ssa-019113.html","https://cert-portal.siemens.com/productcert/html/ssa-082556.html","https://github.com/trickest/cve/blob/ed228d55b7972f63e700a35a54fbcd94064b9ade/2024/CVE-2024-47809.md","https://github.com/CVEProject/cvelistV5/blob/60bbc98c39201e6f5661b9e41f1492ce39335948/cves/2024/47xxx/CVE-2024-47809.json","https://github.com/NUS-Curiosity/KernJC/blob/798845a541a5396395c7e0c1670cb4872dac7105/db/vuln_desc/2024/CVE-2024-47809.yaml","https://github.com/imSkows/Cyber-Vulnerability-Analysis-Data/blob/db26c44c5f45c25514223a46675daec7eea03092/data/first/CVE-2024-47809","https://github.com/cisagov/vulnrichment/blob/a538bd81432b918b342e413f43256da1f80b6c0d/2024/47xxx/CVE-2024-47809.json","https://github.com/bell-sw/osv-database/blob/ee84993ad655ae5f90f9948f27d13851ad8b9fd3/BELL-CVE/BELL-CVE-2024-47809.json","https://github.com/github/advisory-database/blob/d8c03b84658bbca948e09e4af723cb11141fb41e/advisories/unreviewed/2025/01/GHSA-9fhm-w5m6-rqv5/GHSA-9fhm-w5m6-rqv5.json","https://github.com/TonneauBenjamin/ANSSI_Project/blob/f0e2d5e8be75f0351e759642d04d728399b4faa9/data/raw/first/CVE-2024-47809","https://github.com/Patrowl/PatrowlHearsData/blob/f0111a41156462d46f484c055bdeafa69cf38c8e/SSVC/data/2024/CVE-2024-47809.json","https://github.com/equinixmetal-images/changelog/blob/43c481d19f0a015611a5309a435c9b590b5b5bc2/flatcar/flatcar_stable.md"],"poc_urls":[],"exp_urls":[],"repo_poc_urls":[],"repo_exp_urls":[],"has_poc":false,"has_exp":false,"raw_url":"https://github.com/adysec/AVE/blob/main/vulns/2024/AVE-2024-0532.toml"},{"ave_id":"AVE-2024-0531","file_name":"2024/AVE-2024-0531.toml","cve_id":"CVE-2024-47794","title":"Linux Kernel BPF 尾调用无限循环拒绝服务漏洞","description":"Linux 内核 BPF 子系统中存在一个由 freplace 程序与尾调用（tailcall）组合引发的无限循环漏洞。当 entry_freplace 的附加目标为 subprog_tc，而尾调用又指向 entry_tc 时，会形成 entry_tc → subprog_tc → entry_freplace → tailcall → entry_tc 的死循环。由于每次执行 entry_freplace 时 tail_call_cnt 计数器都会重置为零，尾调用机制无法终止，最终导致内核崩溃（kernel panic）。本地攻击者只需低权限即可触发此漏洞，造成系统拒绝服务。该漏洞影响 Linux 内核各发行版版本，CVSS 评分 5.5，危害等级中等。","severity":"MEDIUM","score":5.5,"aliases":["CVE-2024-47794"],"sources":["msrc"],"published":"2025-01-11T13:15:22.390","updated":"2026-06-17T07:57:45.727","remediation":"立即将 Linux 内核升级至 6.12.5 或更高版本（主线内核已包含修复提交 987aa730bad3 和 d6083f040d5d）。各发行版用户请安装对应安全更新：Ubuntu 24.04 LTS 安装 USN-7381-1 或 USN-7450-1 更新，SUSE Linux Enterprise 15 SP6 安装 SUSE-SU-2025:1177-1 更新。如无法立即升级，可通过 seccomp 限制 BPF 系统调用（禁用 bpf() 和 BPF_PROG_TYPE_EXT 相关操作）作为临时缓解措施。","status":"completed","collected_at":"2026-07-22T00:00:00Z","references":["https://git.kernel.org/stable/c/987aa730bad3e1ef66d9f30182294daa78f6387d","https://git.kernel.org/stable/c/d6083f040d5d8f8d748462c77e90547097df936e","https://github.com/CVEProject/cvelistV5/blob/60bbc98c39201e6f5661b9e41f1492ce39335948/cves/2024/47xxx/CVE-2024-47794.json","https://github.com/NUS-Curiosity/KernJC/blob/798845a541a5396395c7e0c1670cb4872dac7105/db/vuln_desc/2024/CVE-2024-47794.yaml","https://github.com/imSkows/Cyber-Vulnerability-Analysis-Data/blob/db26c44c5f45c25514223a46675daec7eea03092/data/first/CVE-2024-47794","https://github.com/yarencheng/cve-devops-playground/blob/cbe73d6bdcced13ea57f08566d6bbf5345864f7e/content/CVE-2024-47794.md","https://github.com/bell-sw/osv-database/blob/ee84993ad655ae5f90f9948f27d13851ad8b9fd3/BELL-CVE/BELL-CVE-2024-47794.json","https://github.com/Patrowl/PatrowlHearsData/blob/f0111a41156462d46f484c055bdeafa69cf38c8e/CVE/data/2024/CVE-2024-47794.json","https://github.com/joaop9425/manual-do-tecnico/blob/cc6e0f5304777f18e55db554da5372bc31d4cae1/src/content/noticias/2026/01/08/seguranca/cve-2024-47794-bpf-prevent-tailcall-infinite-loop--1767883860000.md","https://github.com/Hashmire/cpeApplicabilityGeneratorPages/blob/4588dccb1f913705444975eb2a5eb79962bf2513/generated_pages/CVE-2024-47794.html","https://github.com/github/advisory-database/blob/d8c03b84658bbca948e09e4af723cb11141fb41e/advisories/unreviewed/2025/01/GHSA-qrrc-56f8-gw3j/GHSA-qrrc-56f8-gw3j.json","https://github.com/TonneauBenjamin/ANSSI_Project/blob/f0e2d5e8be75f0351e759642d04d728399b4faa9/data/raw/first/CVE-2024-47794"],"poc_urls":[],"exp_urls":[],"repo_poc_urls":[],"repo_exp_urls":[],"has_poc":false,"has_exp":false,"raw_url":"https://github.com/adysec/AVE/blob/main/vulns/2024/AVE-2024-0531.toml"},{"ave_id":"AVE-2024-0527","file_name":"2024/AVE-2024-0527.toml","cve_id":"CVE-2024-47141","title":"Linux Kernel pinmux 竞争条件空指针解引用漏洞","description":"Linux 内核 pinmux 子系统中存在竞争条件漏洞，当两个进程同时对同一 GPIO 引脚调用 pinctrl_select_state() 时，由于对 desc->mux_owner 的访问缺乏互斥保护，一个进程更新 desc->mux_usecount 后尚未设置 mux_owner，另一进程检测到 usecount 非零后访问空指针 mux_owner 进行 strcmp 比较，导致空指针解引用引发内核崩溃。本地攻击者可通过低权限账户并发触发该条件造成拒绝服务。该漏洞影响 Linux 内核多个版本，CVSS 评分 5.5，危害等级中等。Linux 内核社区已通过引入互斥锁序列化 mux 相关设置访问修复此问题。","severity":"MEDIUM","score":5.5,"aliases":["CVE-2024-47141"],"sources":["msrc"],"published":"2025-01-11T13:15:21.830","updated":"2026-06-17T07:56:37.030","remediation":"建议将 Linux 内核升级至 6.6.66、6.12.5 或 6.13 及以上版本，该漏洞已通过提交 2da32aed4a97 修复。Ubuntu 24.04 LTS 用户可安装 linux-image-6.11.0-1011-lowlatency（USN-7381-1）或 linux-image-6.8.0-1028-gcp（USN-7450-1）并重启系统。如无法立即升级，可限制本地用户对 GPIO/pinctrl 设备的访问作为临时缓解。","status":"completed","collected_at":"2026-07-22T00:00:00Z","references":["https://git.kernel.org/stable/c/2da32aed4a97ca1d70fb8b77926f72f30ce5fb4b","https://git.kernel.org/stable/c/5a3e85c3c397c781393ea5fb2f45b1f60f8a4e6e","https://git.kernel.org/stable/c/c11e2ec9a780f54982a187ee10ffd1b810715c85","https://github.com/CVEProject/cvelistV5/blob/528991f6906b29893dd0e43e65862cd92fd607c8/cves/2024/47xxx/CVE-2024-47141.json","https://github.com/NUS-Curiosity/KernJC/blob/798845a541a5396395c7e0c1670cb4872dac7105/db/vuln_desc/2024/CVE-2024-47141.yaml","https://github.com/cisagov/vulnrichment/blob/4a810b0db2e9cab67156f722c309e925ee8f02