e.d/blacklist-i3c.conf`）作为临时缓解。","status":"completed","collected_at":"2026-07-22T00:00:00Z","references":["https://git.kernel.org/stable/c/19cc5767334bfe980f52421627d0826c0da86721","https://git.kernel.org/stable/c/6ca2738174e4ee44edb2ab2d86ce74f015a0cc32","https://git.kernel.org/stable/c/9d745a56aea45e47f4755bc12e6429d6314dbb54","https://git.kernel.org/stable/c/a6cddf68b3405b272b5a3cad9657be0b02b34bf4","https://git.kernel.org/stable/c/a6dc4b4fda2e147e557050eaae51ff15edeb680b","https://lists.debian.org/debian-lts-announce/2025/03/msg00001.html","https://github.com/trickest/cve/blob/ed228d55b7972f63e700a35a54fbcd94064b9ade/2024/CVE-2024-45828.md","https://github.com/CVEProject/cvelistV5/blob/528991f6906b29893dd0e43e65862cd92fd607c8/cves/2024/45xxx/CVE-2024-45828.json","https://github.com/NUS-Curiosity/KernJC/blob/798845a541a5396395c7e0c1670cb4872dac7105/db/vuln_desc/2024/CVE-2024-45828.yaml","https://github.com/imSkows/Cyber-Vulnerability-Analysis-Data/blob/db26c44c5f45c25514223a46675daec7eea03092/data/first/CVE-2024-45828","https://github.com/cisagov/vulnrichment/blob/4a810b0db2e9cab67156f722c309e925ee8f02a0/2024/45xxx/CVE-2024-45828.json","https://github.com/bell-sw/osv-database/blob/ee84993ad655ae5f90f9948f27d13851ad8b9fd3/BELL-CVE/BELL-CVE-2024-45828.json","https://github.com/CVEProject/cve-reference-ingest-data/blob/9c21390c1b52354f2bcded00c6f9b47d11852fe2/references/CveServices-CVE-2024-45828-2025-11-03-1432","https://github.com/mabitoski/cve_submodules/blob/44ad7e2705b3aef1b2ffaf64bd47596c10a6c2e4/2024/CVE-2024-45828.md","https://github.com/github/advisory-database/blob/db909d46c3d9b98ec1f95daa3c88d7a8990ea8f5/advisories/unreviewed/2025/01/GHSA-qrf2-8jcf-fv7v/GHSA-qrf2-8jcf-fv7v.json","https://github.com/TonneauBenjamin/ANSSI_Project/blob/f0e2d5e8be75f0351e759642d04d728399b4faa9/data/raw/first/CVE-2024-45828"],"poc_urls":[],"exp_urls":[],"repo_poc_urls":[],"repo_exp_urls":[],"has_poc":false,"has_exp":false,"raw_url":"https://github.com/adysec/AVE/blob/main/vulns/2024/AVE-2024-0524.toml"},{"ave_id":"AVE-2024-0509","file_name":"2024/AVE-2024-0509.toml","cve_id":"CVE-2024-43098","title":"Linux Kernel i3c 递归锁导致死锁漏洞","description":"Linux 内核 i3c 子系统存在死锁漏洞，i3c_master_register() 函数在注册 i3c 设备时重复获取 i3cbus->lock 锁，导致递归加锁引发内核死锁。本地攻击者可利用此漏洞触发系统拒绝服务。该漏洞影响 Linux 内核多个版本，CVSS 评分 5.5，危害等级中等。开发者已通过直接使用 i3cdev->desc->info 替代重复调用 i3c_device_get_info() 的方式修复此问题。","severity":"MEDIUM","score":5.5,"aliases":["CVE-2024-43098"],"sources":["msrc"],"published":"2025-01-11T13:15:21.240","updated":"2026-06-17T07:50:26.150","remediation":"及时将 Linux 内核升级至以下已修复版本：5.4.287、5.10.231、5.15.174、6.1.120、6.6.66 或 6.12.5 及更高版本。补丁已合入主线及 LTS 分支，可通过 `git cherry-pick` 应用内核仓库中的 7 个对应提交。如无法升级内核，可禁用 CONFIG_I3C 内核选项，或在系统启动时通过内核参数 `i3c.disable=1` 关闭 i3c 驱动避免触发死锁。","status":"completed","collected_at":"2026-07-22T00:00:00Z","references":["https://git.kernel.org/stable/c/1f51ae217d09c361ede900b94735a6d2df6c0344","https://git.kernel.org/stable/c/2d98fa2a50b8058de52ada168fa5dbabb574711b","https://git.kernel.org/stable/c/5ac1dd51aaa0ce8b5421d1137e857955a4b6f55e","https://git.kernel.org/stable/c/6cf7b65f7029914dc0cd7db86fac9ee5159008c6","https://git.kernel.org/stable/c/816187b1833908941286e71b0041059a4acd52ed","https://git.kernel.org/stable/c/9a2173660ee53d5699744f02e6ab7bf89fcd0b1a","https://git.kernel.org/stable/c/ffe19e363c6f8b992ba835a361542568dea17409","https://lists.debian.org/debian-lts-announce/2025/03/msg00001.html","https://lists.debian.org/debian-lts-announce/2025/03/msg00002.html","https://github.com/trickest/cve/blob/ed228d55b7972f63e700a35a54fbcd94064b9ade/2024/CVE-2024-43098.md","https://github.com/CVEProject/cvelistV5/blob/86060d5336eceede57f01ccb65fb3037638af8db/cves/2024/43xxx/CVE-2024-43098.json","https://github.com/imSkows/Cyber-Vulnerability-Analysis-Data/blob/db26c44c5f45c25514223a46675daec7eea03092/data/first/CVE-2024-43098","https://github.com/NUS-Curiosity/KernJC/blob/798845a541a5396395c7e0c1670cb4872dac7105/db/vuln_desc/2024/CVE-2024-43098.yaml","https://github.com/cisagov/vulnrichment/blob/c82f217443f5e10c0c4e9bda1118e45073d229ba/2024/43xxx/CVE-2024-43098.json","https://github.com/bell-sw/osv-database/blob/ee84993ad655ae5f90f9948f27d13851ad8b9fd3/BELL-CVE/BELL-CVE-2024-43098.json","https://github.com/CVEProject/cve-reference-ingest-data/blob/891e02cb95ef463730509df70a6ab47638098a75/references/CveServices-CVE-2024-43098-2025-11-03-1432","https://github.com/mabitoski/cve_submodules/blob/44ad7e2705b3aef1b2ffaf64bd47596c10a6c2e4/2024/CVE-2024-43098.md","https://github.com/github/advisory-database/blob/1684cfa32e43376c48beb06819bce86de6ba421b/advisories/unreviewed/2025/01/GHSA-g6f8-f8f2-6wh5/GHSA-g6f8-f8f2-6wh5.json","https://github.com/TonneauBenjamin/ANSSI_Project/blob/f0e2d5e8be75f0351e759642d04d728399b4faa9/data/raw/first/CVE-2024-43098"],"poc_urls":[],"exp_urls":[],"repo_poc_urls":[],"repo_exp_urls":[],"has_poc":false,"has_exp":false,"raw_url":"https://github.com/adysec/AVE/blob/main/vulns/2024/AVE-2024-0509.toml"},{"ave_id":"AVE-2024-0507","file_name":"2024/AVE-2024-0507.toml","cve_id":"CVE-2024-41935","title":"Linux Kernel f2fs 读取范围节点批量缩小拒绝服务漏洞","description":"Linux 内核 f2fs 文件系统在收缩 extent tree（读取范围树）时，使用读写锁（rwlock）保护核心结构数据。当 extent tree 中存在大量 extent node 时，收缩过程会长时间持有该读写锁，导致内核挂起（kernel hang），形成拒绝服务（DoS）漏洞。本地攻击者可通过触发 f2fs 文件系统大量 extent node 的创建与收缩操作来利用此漏洞。该漏洞影响 Linux 内核各版本，CVSS 评分 7.1，危害等级高。","severity":"HIGH","score":7.1,"aliases":["CVE-2024-41935"],"sources":["msrc"],"published":"2025-01-11T13:15:21.083","updated":"2026-06-17T07:48:28.920","remediation":"升级 Linux 内核至 6.6.66、6.12.5 或 6.13 及以上版本，其中已合入批量收缩 extent 节点读写锁持有时间的修复补丁。如无法立即升级，可通过内核参数 `mitigations=auto` 启用内核默认缓解机制，并避免在 f2fs 文件系统上执行大量文件删除/截断操作以减少 extent 树收缩触发频率。","status":"completed","collected_at":"2026-07-22T00:00:00Z","references":["https://git.kernel.org/stable/c/295b50e95e900da31ff237e46e04525fa799b2cf","https://git.kernel.org/stable/c/3fc5d5a182f6a1f8bd4dc775feb54c369dd2c343","https://git.kernel.org/stable/c/924f7dd1e832e4e4530d14711db223d2803f7b61","https://github.com/CVEProject/cvelistV5/blob/56b9e9b42ce0a91a448094549973b81cdf8e832e/cves/2024/41xxx/CVE-2024-41935.json","https://github.com/NUS-Curiosity/KernJC/blob/798845a541a5396395c7e0c1670cb4872dac7105/db/vuln_desc/2024/CVE-2024-41935.yaml","https://github.com/imSkows/Cyber-Vulnerability-Analysis-Data/blob/db26c44c5f45c25514223a46675daec7eea03092/data/first/CVE-2024-41935","https://github.com/yarencheng/cve-devops-playground/blob/cbe73d6bdcced13ea57f08566d6bbf5345864f7e/content/CVE-2024-41935.md","https://github.com/bell-sw/osv-database/blob/ee84993ad655ae5f90f9948f27d13851ad8b9fd3/BELL-CVE/BELL-CVE-2024-41935.json","https://github.com/Patrowl/PatrowlHearsData/blob/61756b9c4d4c30577cc003b0b28e3db71ca30a1e/CVE/data/2024/CVE-2024-41935.json","https://github.com/Hashmire/cpeApplicabilityGeneratorPages/blob/4588dccb1f913705444975eb2a5eb79962bf2513/generated_pages/CVE-2024-41935.html","https://github.com/github/advisory-database/blob/1684cfa32e43376c48beb06819bce86de6ba421b/advisories/unreviewed/2025/01/GHSA-mrcm-jxqx-2mxp/GHSA-mrcm-jxqx-2mxp.json","https://github.com/TonneauBenjamin/ANSSI_Project/blob/f0e2d5e8be75f0351e759642d04d728399b4faa9/data/raw/first/CVE-2024-41935","https://github.com/canonical/ubuntu-security-notices/blob/c723932b6cef36d7df29b07fee2ccc4a2e5a8288/usn/7379-2.json"],"poc_urls":[],"exp_urls":[],"repo_poc_urls":[],"repo_exp_urls":[],"has_poc":false,"has_exp":false,"raw_url":"https://github.com/adysec/AVE/blob/main/vulns/2024/AVE-2024-0507.toml"},{"ave_id":"AVE-2024-0506","file_name":"2024/AVE-2024-0506.toml","cve_id":"CVE-2024-41932","title":"Linux Kernel 调度器 sched_setaffinity CPU 亲和性竞态条件漏洞","description":"Linux 内核调度器中的 sched_setaffinity 系统调用存在竞态条件漏洞。当任务的 CPU 亲和性设置与 cpuset 控制组更新同时发生时，由于验证逻辑不完善，内核会误触发 WARN 告警。本地攻击者可通过在 cpuset cgroup 中反复切换 CPU 范围并同时设置目标进程的 CPU 亲和性来利用此漏洞，导致内核输出告警信息，可能引发拒绝服务。该漏洞影响 Linux 内核各版本，CVSS 评分 5.5，危害等级中等。","severity":"MEDIUM","score":5.5,"aliases":["CVE-2024-41932"],"sources":["msrc"],"published":"2025-01-11T13:15:20.930","updated":"2026-06-17T07:48:28.710","remediation":"建议立即升级 Linux 内核至 6.12.5 或更高版本，该版本已包含修复补丁（提交 5c3fb75f538c / 70ee7947a290）。如无法立即升级，可通过内核启动参数添加 `sched_setaffinity_warning=0` 临时抑制相关警告，或在生产环境中使用 cgroup 限制非特权用户的 cpuset 操作权限作为缓解措施。","status":"completed","collected_at":"2026-07-22T00:00:00Z","references":["https://git.kernel.org/stable/c/5c3fb75f538cfcb886f6dfeb497d99fc2f263ee6","https://git.kernel.org/stable/c/70ee7947a29029736a1a06c73a48ff37674a851b","https://github.com/CVEProject/cvelistV5/blob/56b9e9b42ce0a91a448094549973b81cdf8e832e/cves/2024/41xxx/CVE-2024-41932.json","https://github.com/NUS-Curiosity/KernJC/blob/798845a541a5396395c7e0c1670cb4872dac7105/db/vuln_desc/2024/CVE-2024-41932.yaml","https://github.com/KaweGG/vulnerability_tracker/blob/01de5763b71f6c005791d4aa8121132990782604/cves/CVE-2024-41932.md","https://github.com/imSkows/Cyber-Vulnerability-Analysis-Data/blob/db26c44c5f45c25514223a46675daec7eea03092/data/first/CVE-2024-41932","https://github.com/bell-sw/osv-database/blob/ee84993ad655ae5f90f9948f27d13851ad8b9fd3/BELL-CVE/BELL-CVE-2024-41932.json","https://github.com/Patrowl/PatrowlHearsData/blob/61756b9c4d4c30577cc003b0b28e3db71ca30a1e/CVE/data/2024/CVE-2024-41932.json","https://github.com/joaop9425/manual-do-tecnico/blob/cc6e0f5304777f18e55db554da5372bc31d4cae1/src/content/noticias/2026/01/08/seguranca/cve-2024-41932-sched-fix-warning-in-sched-setaffin-1767883750000.md","https://github.com/Hashmire/cpeApplicabilityGeneratorPages/blob/4588dccb1f913705444975eb2a5eb79962bf2513/generated_pages/CVE-2024-41932.html","https://github.com/github/advisory-database/blob/1684cfa32e43376c48beb06819bce86de6ba421b/advisories/unreviewed/2025/01/GHSA-r78q-c787-rf79/GHSA-r78q-c787-rf79.json","https://github.com/TonneauBenjamin/ANSSI_Project/blob/f0e2d5e8be75f0351e759642d04d728399b4faa9/data/raw/first/CVE-2024-41932"],"poc_urls":[],"exp_urls":[],"repo_poc_urls":[],"repo_exp_urls":[],"has_poc":false,"has_exp":false,"raw_url":"https://github.com/adysec/AVE/blob/main/vuln